@startuml CrearUsuario
actor "Tecnico" as T
participant "Frontend React" as FE
participant "API REST Django" as API
participant "Proxy LDAP" as PROXY
database "Directorio Activo" as AD

T -> FE: POST /servers/{id}/users/
FE -> API: POST /servers/{id}/users/
API -> PROXY: CreateUserUseCase.execute()
PROXY -> AD: proxy.add(dn, classes, attrs)
AD --> PROXY: Resultado OK
PROXY --> API: Response 201 Created
API --> FE: JSON con usuario creado
FE --> T: Muestra resultado en pantalla
@enduml
